From: Vincent Wondra <vincent@thebbsagency.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 21:27:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add GA4 tracking (G-JYC9K08JQE) to all published pages

Inserts the gtag.js snippet immediately after <head> on all 12 published
pages, and in the doc() template in src/build/build.mjs so future rebuilds
keep it.

The tag was inserted directly into the generated HTML rather than by
rebuilding: src/servicesData.js has drifted from the published pages, so a
rebuild reverts the images updated in 50db871 (and their alt text) on
services/, prototyping, cnc-precision-machining, reverse-engineering and
shop-to-shop. No other markup was changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tvyf9SQ6m6YRWUva9A9oYg
